 "researcher_notes": "Verified: FERC docket CP26-74 (Federal Register EA schedule notice, 13 Apr 2026), Pipeline and Gas Journal March 2026, and EIA Aug 2026 release (sheet 'Natural Gas Pipeline Projects', Excel row 133, status Applied, 19.3 mi, 16 in, in service 2028). Application filed 21 Jan 2026; environmental assessment due 9 Oct 2026. 19.33 miles (31 km) of new 16-inch Line UA ties to existing 20-inch Line U and serves Evergy's 710 MW Viola plant; it also adds a 12,375 HP Wellington compressor station. Not in the roster: Cedar Vale (P7826) is a different project. Shaped as an expansion row under the parent Southern Star Central Gas Pipeline name. Capacity is the firm transport up to 116,296 Dth/d, kept in source units. Route not researched; no route found. EIA is one origin, so the FERC notice and trade press are the independent pair. Pipeline and Gas Journal and Federal Register also name the project; Parent and start and end coordinates not sourced."
